1
00:00:00,735 --> 00:00:02,065
(Susan:)Very nice, Wyatt.

2
00:00:02,069 --> 00:00:04,699
(Susan:)And you wonder why this one
turned out the way he did.

3
00:00:04,705 --> 00:00:07,035
(Randall:)You see what I've gotta
put up with!

4
00:00:07,041 --> 00:00:09,041
(Susan:)What you've gotta put up with?

5
00:00:09,043 --> 00:00:10,743
(Susan:)Why did you have
to go to jail?

6
00:00:10,745 --> 00:00:13,965
(Randall:)It's called getting
caught, Mother!

7
00:00:13,965 --> 00:00:15,665
Hello!

8
00:00:15,666 --> 00:00:16,836
Hey, there he is!
Hey!

9
00:00:16,834 --> 00:00:19,754
Oh, Leonard! It's so
nice to see you again!

10
00:00:19,754 --> 00:00:20,834
Oh, you, too!

11
00:00:20,838 --> 00:00:23,308
(Leonard:)Hey, everyone, this is
my mother, Beverly.

12
00:00:23,307 --> 00:00:24,427
(Howard:)- Hello.
- Hi.

13
00:00:24,425 --> 00:00:27,645
We are not white trash!

14
00:00:31,899 --> 00:00:34,319
(Amy:)Are you excited to see your son
walk down the aisle?

15
00:00:34,318 --> 00:00:35,438
(Alfred:)Yes, I am.

16
00:00:35,436 --> 00:00:36,656
(Alfred:)I'm just feeling
a little guilty

17
00:00:36,654 --> 00:00:38,434
(Alfred:)about all the trouble
I've caused.

18
00:00:38,439 --> 00:00:40,109
(Mary:)Oh, so am I.

19
00:00:40,107 --> 00:00:43,607
(Sheldon:)You made God sad today, Mom.

20
00:00:50,585 --> 00:00:52,255
(Amy:)Sheldon, they haven't done
anything wrong.

21
00:00:52,253 --> 00:00:54,783
(Amy:)I think it's nice
they're hitting it off.

22
00:00:54,789 --> 00:00:56,459
(Sheldon:)Well, that's still no reason
to rush into anything.

23
00:00:56,457 --> 00:00:57,537
(Sheldon:)Look at us.

24
00:00:57,541 --> 00:00:59,261
(Sheldon:)We took things
remarkably slow.

25
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)You and I, we didn't even
hold hands for two years.

